  "ringout_map": "orig_end = out_t - 0.08 when ringout; t1 not stretched",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "para": 0,
      "text": "比特币跌到五万六千美元，有一个指标，我觉得值得拿出来聊聊。",
      "last_char": "聊",
      "i0": 0,
      "i1": 29,
      "t0_vo": -0.000104,
      "t1_vo": 3.560333,
      "orig_end_vo": 3.726,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.9230769230769231,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.42
    },
    {
      "para": 1,
      "text": "这个指标叫 Ahr999，通常也叫九神指数。",
      "last_char": "数",
      "i0": 29,
      "i1": 51,
      "t0_vo": 4.175833,
      "t1_vo": 7.308114,
      "orig_end_vo": 7.524,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.8947368421052632,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.43
    },
    {
      "para": 2,
      "text": "为了好理解，咱们就叫它抄底指数。",
      "last_char": "数",
      "i0": 51,
      "i1": 67,
      "t0_vo": 8.004146,
      "t1_vo": 9.964146,
      "orig_end_vo": 10.121,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.8571428571428571,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "para": 3,
      "text": "抄底指数已经掉到了零点二三附近，快到二零二零年三一二币灾时的位置了。",
      "last_char": "了",
      "i0": 67,
      "i1": 101,
      "t0_vo": 10.861521,
      "t1_vo": 15.95499,
      "orig_end_vo": 16.048000000000002,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.53125,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.44
    },
    {
      "para": 4,
      "text": "这算不算买点？",
      "last_char": "点",
      "i0": 101,
      "i1": 108,
      "t0_vo": 16.517646,
      "t1_vo": 17.037646,
      "orig_end_vo": 17.205000000000002,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 1.0,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.44
    },
    {
      "para": 5,
      "text": "我的看法是，单看历史估值，这个位置已经值得认真关注了。",
      "last_char": "了",
      "i0": 108,
      "i1": 135,
      "t0_vo": 17.685125,
      "t1_vo": 21.692625,
      "orig_end_vo": 21.825000000000003,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.9166666666666666,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.47
    },
    {
      "para": 6,
      "text": "但五万六到底是不是底，还得看市场上的币卖出来，有没有人接。",
      "last_char": "接",
      "i0": 135,
      "i1": 164,
      "t0_vo": 22.344812,
      "t1_vo": 25.730125,
      "orig_end_vo": 25.990000000000002,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.9230769230769231,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.46
    },
    {
      "para": 7,
      "text": "零点二三到底有多少见？",
      "last_char": "见",
      "i0": 164,
      "i1": 175,
      "t0_vo": 27.260146,
      "t1_vo": 27.720146,
      "orig_end_vo": 28.104000000000003,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.5,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.44
    },
    {
      "para": 8,
      "text": "从这份历史回算看，二零一七年到二零二五年，整整九年，低于零点二五的只有两天，都在二零二零年三月。",
      "last_char": "月",
      "i0": 175,
      "i1": 223,
      "t0_vo": 28.58425,
      "t1_vo": 35.779125,
      "orig_end_vo": 35.963,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.5813953488372093,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "para": 9,
      "text": "三月十二日大约零点二二八，跟现在已经很接近了。",
      "last_char": "了",
      "i0": 223,
      "i1": 246,
      "t0_vo": 36.582812,
      "t1_vo": 39.388875,
      "orig_end_vo": 39.527,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.6190476190476191,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.44
    },
    {
      "para": 10,
      "text": "再往前，二零一一年还到过零点一五附近。",
      "last_char": "近",
      "i0": 246,
      "i1": 265,
      "t0_vo": 39.997083,
      "t1_vo": 43.086021,
      "orig_end_vo": 43.268,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.7647058823529411,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.44
    },
    {
      "para": 11,
      "text": "当然，那时候比特币还很早期，跟今天差别很大。",
      "last_char": "大",
      "i0": 265,
      "i1": 287,
      "t0_vo": 43.747562,
      "t1_vo": 46.427844,
      "orig_end_vo": 46.61,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 1.0,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.43
    },
    {
      "para": 12,
      "text": "我们就拿零点一五做个压力测试：假设现在模型里的参考条件不动，对应的币价大约四万四千八，比五万六还低两成。",
      "last_char": "成",
      "i0": 287,
      "i1": 339,
      "t0_vo": 47.069875,
      "t1_vo": 54.518344,
      "orig_end_vo": 54.775,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.7916666666666666,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.46
    },
    {
      "para": 13,
      "text": "这个可能的下跌空间，也得摆在桌面上。",
      "last_char": "上",
      "i0": 339,
      "i1": 357,
      "t0_vo": 55.305625,
      "t1_vo": 57.542251,
      "orig_end_vo": 57.727000000000004,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 1.0,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.44
    },
    {
      "para": 14,
      "text": "有人可能会问，五万六都快跌到挖矿成本了，还能往哪儿跌？",
      "last_char": "跌",
      "i0": 357,
      "i1": 384,
      "t0_vo": 58.206437,
      "t1_vo": 61.902499,
      "orig_end_vo": 62.087,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.9166666666666666,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "para": 15,
      "text": "按一度电六美分估算，普通 S21 挖一枚光电费就要五万四美元左右，场租、维修和折旧还没算。",
      "last_char": "算",
      "i0": 384,
      "i1": 429,
      "t0_vo": 62.597187,
      "t1_vo": 69.904688,
      "orig_end_vo": 70.09,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.8205128205128205,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "para": 16,
      "text": "但这个成本只算矿机用电。",
      "last_char": "电",
      "i0": 429,
      "i1": 441,
      "t0_vo": 70.559833,
      "t1_vo": 71.919833,
      "orig_end_vo": 72.237,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.9090909090909091,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.44
    },
    {
      "para": 17,
      "text": "我更关心的是资金。",
      "last_char": "金",
      "i0": 441,
      "i1": 450,
      "t0_vo": 72.716875,
      "t1_vo": 73.516875,
      "orig_end_vo": 73.738,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 1.0,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.47
    },
    {
      "para": 18,
      "text": "十一月十九日，美国现货比特币 ETF 一天净流出大约五亿八千万美元。",
      "last_char": "元",
      "i0": 450,
      "i1": 484,
      "t0_vo": 74.447958,
      "t1_vo": 79.156802,
      "orig_end_vo": 79.406,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.7333333333333333,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.46
    },
    {
      "para": 19,
      "text": "按当天币价算，这笔钱相当于二十一天新挖出来的币的价值。",
      "last_char": "值",
      "i0": 484,
      "i1": 511,
      "t0_vo": 79.9065,
      "t1_vo": 83.6065,
      "orig_end_vo": 83.818,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.8,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.49
    },
    {
      "para": 20,
      "text": "这里比的是金额。",
      "last_char": "额",
      "i0": 511,
      "i1": 519,
      "t0_vo": 84.377875,
      "t1_vo": 85.057875,
      "orig_end_vo": 85.345,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 1.0,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "para": 21,
      "text": "矿工可以关机器，市场上已经流通的币，照样有人卖。",
      "last_char": "卖",
      "i0": 519,
      "i1": 543,
      "t0_vo": 85.934937,
      "t1_vo": 89.132312,
      "orig_end_vo": 89.389,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.9523809523809523,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "para": 22,
      "text": "接下来，我会看两件事：ETF 连续五个交易日加起来，资金能不能转成净流入？",
      "last_char": "入",
      "i0": 543,
      "i1": 580,
      "t0_vo": 89.858687,
      "t1_vo": 95.588999,
      "orig_end_vo": 95.761,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.96875,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.44
    },
    {
      "para": 23,
      "text": "反弹之后，再回到这次低点附近，能不能守住？",
      "last_char": "住",
      "i0": 580,
      "i1": 601,
      "t0_vo": 96.261521,
      "t1_vo": 99.136459,
      "orig_end_vo": 99.312,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 1.0,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.44
    },
    {
      "para": 24,
      "text": "估值低，说明这个位置值得看。",
      "last_char": "看",
      "i0": 601,
      "i1": 615,
      "t0_vo": 99.932146,
      "t1_vo": 101.332146,
      "orig_end_vo": 101.471,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.8333333333333334,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.42
    },
    {
      "para": 25,
      "text": "跌下来的时候有人接，这个买点才更有说服力。",
      "last_char": "力",
      "i0": 615,
      "i1": 636,
      "t0_vo": 101.980833,
      "t1_vo": 104.565583,
      "orig_end_vo": 104.702,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.9473684210526315,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": 0.44
    },
    {
      "para": 26,
      "text": "以上只是市场数据分析和我的个人判断，不构成投资建议。",
      "last_char": "议",
      "i0": 636,
      "i1": 662,
      "t0_vo": 105.182271,
      "t1_vo": 108.836522,
      "orig_end_vo": 108.971,
      "ringout_s": 0.08,
      "align_ratio": 0.9166666666666666,
      "method": "para_end_ringout_80ms",
      "gap": null
    }
